# Trivy ignore list — every entry needs a reason and an expiry (exp:), so a
# suppression can never outlive the condition that justified it. After the
# expiry date the finding fails the ci.yml gate again. Mirrors iam-audit-log's,
# iam-catalog-admin's and iam-org-membership's entries for the same advisory.

# DLA-4792-1 — tzdata 2026b → 2026c in gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot.
# A timezone-database refresh, not a security flaw (Trivy: UNKNOWN; the CI gate
# fails on UNKNOWN). Not exploitable here: the service never loads a zone (no
# time.LoadLocation, no time/tzdata, no time.Local use; all timestamps are UTC).
# Blocked upstream: on 2026-10-04 the newest :nonroot digest (sha256:afa5c872…,
# pinned in the Dockerfile) still ships tzdata 2026b. Remove this entry and
# re-pin (`make pin-base-images`) once distroless ships 2026c.
DLA-4792-1 exp:2026-10-31

# DLA-4845-1: ca-certificates 20250419~deb12u1 → deb12u2 (removes the
# distrusted Comodo "AAA Certificate Services" and "emSign ECC Root CA - G3"
# roots). gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot does not yet ship the
# fixed package; the Dockerfile's pinned digest is already the latest
# upstream (checked 2026-10-22). The exposure itself is closed: the
# Dockerfile's certs stage (debian:bookworm-slim, deb12u2) replaces
# distroless's /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt — verified 150 → 148 certs,
# both roots absent. Trivy still reports the finding only because it reads
# distroless's dpkg status metadata. The expiry forces a re-check: remove this
# entry, the certs stage and its COPY, and bump the runtime digest once
# distroless ships deb12u2. Same fix as iam-org-membership 9bc235e.
DLA-4845-1 exp:2026-11-21

# DLA-4854-1: tzdata 2026b-0+deb12u1 → 2026e-0+deb12u1, a timezone-database
# refresh (Trivy: UNKNOWN; the CI gate fails on UNKNOWN). Same package and
# situation as DLA-4792-1 above.
# Not exploitable here: the service never loads a zone (no time.LoadLocation, no
# time/tzdata, no time.Local use; all timestamps are UTC).
# Blocked upstream: on 2026-10-26 the newest gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12
# :nonroot digest (sha256:afa5c872…) still ships tzdata 2026b. Remove this
# entry and re-pin once distroless ships tzdata >= 2026e.
DLA-4854-1 exp:2026-11-30

# DLA-4867-1: tzdata 2026b-0+deb12u1 → 2026f-0+deb12u1, the next timezone-
# database refresh after DLA-4854-1 (Trivy: UNKNOWN; the CI gate fails on
# UNKNOWN). Same package and situation as DLA-4854-1 above.
# Not exploitable here: the service never loads a zone (no time.LoadLocation, no
# time/tzdata, no time.Local use; all timestamps are UTC).
# Blocked upstream: on 2026-10-30 the newest gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12
# :nonroot digest (sha256:afa5c872…) still ships tzdata 2026b. Remove this
# entry (with DLA-4854-1) and re-pin once distroless ships tzdata >= 2026f.
DLA-4867-1 exp:2026-11-30
